// error: write `char`, which is one byte
// error: C+ has no 'unsigned int' type
// error: write `int`, which has the same size; C+ has no unsigned types yet
// error: C+ has no 'signed char' type
// error: C+ has no C-style arrays
// error: write `array<char, 64> name`
// error: C+ has no typedef
// error: write a C struct as `struct div_t { int quot; int rem; };`
// error: unknown type 'time_t'
// error: write `long`, which has the same size as 'time_t'
// error: C+ writes the type of a struct or class without the word 'struct'
// error: write just `timeval`, as in C++
// error: write `long`, which has the same size as 'ssize_t'
// error: C+ writes a C type without the word 'struct'
// error: declare the struct once inside extern "C", and then write just `tm`
// error: write just `tm`, as in C++
